The linked academic documents remain preparation snapshots: no scored experiment was performed during their preparation. The subsequent AC01–AC20 study and separately declared coverage have closed under the independent completion checks summarized in section 18. Their original failures, unknowns, two packet-clarity phases and later comparison scopes remain explicit. Human learning, agent weight updates, canonical skill installation and default workflow changes remain unmeasured or unperformed. The earlier completed studies and their original findings remain unchanged.


